---
title: Lingue di pizza
tags: [italian, vegetarian, quick]
cuisine: italian
source: Lingue di Pizza by StarChefs, https://www.starchefs.com/recipes/lingue-di-pizza
---

Heat the oven to 600°F.

Stretch the @pizza dough{400%g} on a lightly floured counter into a long oval.

Spread a thin, even layer of @San Marzano tomatoes{}(crushed) over it, scatter
the @shallots{3}(French, thinly sliced) and drizzle with @olive oil{}.

Slide it onto an oiled #sheet tray{} and bake ~{6%minutes}, until toasted and
charred in spots.

Finish with @parsley{}(chopped), @flaky salt{} and a little more @olive oil{}.
